<p>Remember back in first or second grade when your teacher had you fill out those "Who, What, When, Where, Why, and How?" worksheets? Well it's a good thing you mastered those at age 6 because you're going to need to put that to work again. Your users have those same basic questions when they arrive on your site and it's your reponsibility to answer those as quickly as possible before they're ready to hit that signup button.</p>